 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "primal-planet-243924@4",
   "gameId": "primal-planet-243924",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 4",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-09-18T14:00:22.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today I’m bringing you an update that’s been the most requested lately: ⚡ optimisation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "🖥️ Tested on Lower-End Machines",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks to this update, Primal Planet should now run better on lower-end machines — slightly older laptops and PCs should be able to handle the game much more smoothly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I tested the new build on an older laptop, and it ran surprisingly well:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "OS: Windows 10 64-bit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Processor: Intel Core i3-7100U @ 2.40GHz",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Memory: 6 GB RAM",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Graphics: Intel HD Graphics 620 (Integrated)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "DirectX: Version 11",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Note: The game was tested on integrated graphics. Performance may vary depending on your setup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "💡 Visual Lighting",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Primal Planet features a Visual Lighting system that kicks in during sunrise, sunset, and nighttime — casting the world into darkness, while things like fire, glowing objects, and the player light up their surroundings.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This adds a lot of atmosphere, but it can also impact performance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "To help with that, there’s now an option to disable Visual Lighting in the PC version:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Settings → Accessibility → Visual Lighting (OFF)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you’re on a lower-end machine and still having performance issues, try turning Visual Lighting off to boost your framerate.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Previous updates",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Since the release of Primal Planet, I’ve published three major updates: [dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2350270/view/518594755730343201\"][dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2350270/view/496078025817851671\"][dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/2350270/view/518597293118587345\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "– Albert van Zyl aka Seethingswarm",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Developer of Primal Planet",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2350270/Primal_Planet/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
