  {
   "id": "primal-planet-243924@3",
   "gameId": "primal-planet-243924",
   "displayName": "Update 3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-04T14:05:04.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It’s been a month since Primal Planet launched. Thanks so much to everyone who’s been playing, exploring, and sending in feedback. This third update adds a bit more to the late-game: a mysterious new area beyond the portal, new enemies to deal with, and an extension to the ending that gives a little more insight into the aliens.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43871334/b0acbbd89572f0954f71aff055bf1820f7e1117d.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🚀 What’s New in This Update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👽 ALIEN MOON BASE :.:<.<",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌀 Step through the interstellar portal and discover a strange new world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌌 Explore an otherworldly alien biome filled with new enemies, strange creatures, and atmospheric surprises.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🧠 Face off against a new boss fight and experience an extended ending that reveals more about what the aliens are doing with the dinosaurs.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "👁️‍🗨️ This area adds new lore and late-game content for those who’ve journeyed deep into Primal Planet's secrets.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🛠 OTHER FIXES AND IMPROVEMENTS",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🗺️ Corrected a portal location on the world map for better navigation.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "📈 Reduced the XP required to level up at higher levels. Progression should feel smoother for late-game explorers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔋 Added a few more power cells across the world to help activate portals more reliably.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🎨 Added credits for additional contributing artists and Godot, the game engine powering Primal Planet.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can use your current save file, even if you've already finished the game - everyone should still be able to see the new ending no matter what.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s it for this patch! As always, thank you for playing, sharing feedback, and diving into the strange wilds of Primal Planet. If you’ve been enjoying your journey, consider leaving a review, it really helps others discover the game. 🦕💚",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43871334/0840aa680c11105398a5881ea1aeb7da02b53517.gif\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "– Albert van Zyl aka Seethingswarm",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Developer of Primal Planet",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
